 Type the value and press Enter. Leave it empty to use the default.
 The console's font. The value is the name of a font set (a frit file,
 `NAME.vtfrit` in `/etc/vtium/fonts`). It can also be the name of a kbd console
 font, or with `font-engine = psf` the path of a PSF font; vtium then uses that
